{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158820/extras/21084b4ff9ef0a2f7b003cf18fefc27a.avif?t=1762533598\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chess Knightmare is a variant of chess that is NOT turn-based. The only limit to how often you can move is how fast you can move your mouse. You play as a lone knight, traveling through the country and taking on the armies of chess pieces from your opponents. Each opponent piece has a certain behavior and movement patterns. Try to take the opponent's king with quick thinking, fast mouse speed, and clever knight maneuvers. As you progress, you will be able to unlock a special additional piece that will help you defend yourself: The Rock. Use it to block the opponent from taking you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4158820?t=1762533598","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4158820?t=1762533598","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158820/5d1d1bce53adced4e339f4eb8d200162de688d64/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762533598","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158820/5d1d1bce53adced4e339f4eb8d200162de688d64/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762533598","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158820/extras/21084b4ff9ef0a2f7b003cf18fefc27a.avif?t=1762533598\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chess Knightmare is a variant of chess that is NOT turn-based. The only limit to how often you can move is how fast you can move your mouse. You play as a lone knight, traveling through the country and taking on the armies of chess pieces from your opponents. Each opponent piece has a certain behavior and movement patterns. Try to take the opponent's king with quick thinking, fast mouse speed, and clever knight maneuvers. As you progress, you will be able to unlock a special additional piece that will help you defend yourself: The Rock. Use it to block the opponent from taking you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["RanDev Software"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158820/11f102f9c370a8ad06fc6c29e93901442c36d3d1/header.jpg?t=1762533598","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Chess Knightmare","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 GHz CPU or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics (Intel HD 3000 or better)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 4000 or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["RanDev Software"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia fantasiosa","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age